<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 270 0 R
/T (E-commerce growth has transformed warehouses from passive storage buildings into high-throughput logistics systems. Items must be picked from racks, carried to packing or dispatch docks and returned within strict time windows. Fleets of autonomous mobile robots \(AMRs\) are now widely used for this purpose because they scale more flexibly than fixed conveyors and can be redeployed as the layout changes.)
/E (E-commerce growth has transformed warehouses from passive storage buildings into high-throughput logistics systems. Items must be picked from racks, carried to packing or dispatch docks and returned within strict time windows. Fleets of autonomous mobile robots \(AMRs\) are now widely used for this purpose because they scale more flexibly than fixed conveyors and can be redeployed as the layout changes.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
