/T (The motivation of this project is to build an academically rigorous and reproducible prototype showing how classical artificial intelligence search techniques, combined with a simple reservation mechanism, can deliver optimal single-robot routes and conflict-free multi-robot plans in an aisle-based warehouse.)
/E (The motivation of this project is to build an academically rigorous and reproducible prototype showing how classical artificial intelligence search techniques, combined with a simple reservation mechanism, can deliver optimal single-robot routes and conflict-free multi-robot plans in an aisle-based warehouse.)
