550 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 271 0 R
/T (The scope covers: \(i\) a weighted grid model of a rack-based warehouse; \(ii\) implementation of BFS, Dijkstra, A* and Greedy Best-First planners in Java 21; \(iii\) a prioritised space-time A* planner for fleets of robots; \(iv\) a browser-based interface served on localhost:8080 that displays the warehouse and three robots; and \(v\) a benchmark harness that measures path cost, nodes expanded, optimality rate and conflict counts over randomised scenarios. The warehouse layout, robot kinematics and task arrivals are simulated; no physical robots or live sensor data are used.)
/E (The scope covers: \(i\) a weighted grid model of a rack-based warehouse; \(ii\) implementation of BFS, Dijkstra, A* and Greedy Best-First planners in Java 21; \(iii\) a prioritised space-time A* planner for fleets of robots; \(iv\) a browser-based interface served on localhost:8080 that displays the warehouse and three robots; and \(v\) a benchmark harness that measures path cost, nodes expanded, optimality rate and conflict counts over randomised scenarios. The warehouse layout, robot kinematics and task arrivals are simulated; no physical robots or live sensor data are used.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
