663 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 274 0 R
/T (Published work reports the properties of each algorithm in isolation, but a student-scale, fully reproducible comparison that combines weighted-cost single-robot planning with conflict-free multi-robot planning on the same warehouse model, and that quantifies how often naive independent planning fails, is less commonly presented. This project fills that gap by implementing both layers in one Java code base and measuring them over randomised scenarios with fixed seeds.)
/E (Published work reports the properties of each algorithm in isolation, but a student-scale, fully reproducible comparison that combines weighted-cost single-robot planning with conflict-free multi-robot planning on the same warehouse model, and that quantifies how often naive independent planning fails, is less commonly presented. This project fills that gap by implementing both layers in one Java code base and measuring them over randomised scenarios with fixed seeds.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [54]
>>
