1066 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 288 0 R
/T (All benchmark results reported in this document were produced by running PathBench.java under OpenJDK 21.0.10 on a Linux system, single-threaded. Planning times are measured but, because the programs run for only a few milliseconds and JVM just-in-time compilation influences them, they are treated as indicative; the principal metrics are deterministic quantities \(path cost, nodes expanded, optimality rate and conflict counts\). Software required to reproduce the work is JDK 21 or later and a web browser; Visual Studio Code with its integrated terminal was used to edit and launch the programs. Python 3 with Matplotlib was used only to draw the figures from the benchmark output.)
/E (All benchmark results reported in this document were produced by running PathBench.java under OpenJDK 21.0.10 on a Linux system, single-threaded. Planning times are measured but, because the programs run for only a few milliseconds and JVM just-in-time compilation influences them, they are treated as indicative; the principal metrics are deterministic quantities \(path cost, nodes expanded, optimality rate and conflict counts\). Software required to reproduce the work is JDK 21 or later and a web browser; Visual Studio Code with its integrated terminal was used to edit and launch the programs. Python 3 with Matplotlib was used only to draw the figures from the benchmark output.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [11]
