/Title (The project shows that a carefully engineered combination of two classical ideas, A* search and space-time reservations, is enough to give small robot fleets optimal routes and conflict-free coordination, and that the claim can be checked with repeatable experiments. The results also highlight where the approach would need to grow: richer motion models, dynamic replanning and larger fleets.)
/Dest [47 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4606 0 R
>>
endobj
