4700 0 obj
<<
/Title (Shorter, conflict-free routes reduce robot travel time and the energy used per task, and fewer collisions and stoppages reduce damage and downtime. Transparent, open planners lower the barrier for small warehouses and training institutes that cannot afford commercial fleet software. Because routes are explainable and measurable, supervisors can audit the behaviour of the fleet. Automation of internal transport also changes the nature of warehouse work, so adoption should be accompanied by training for staff in supervision and maintenance roles.)
/Dest [47 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4671 0 R
>>
endobj
