/Title (Space-time graphs. A space-time graph adds time as a third coordinate so that a robot may wait. A reservation is a \(cell, time\) pair that other robots may not use [4]. This converts a moving-obstacle problem into a static search problem.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4844 0 R
/Prev 4896 0 R
/Next 4897 0 R
>>
endobj
