/Title (The literature establishes that A* is the standard optimal single-robot planner on grids, that decoupled planning with a space-time reservation table is a practical way to coordinate small and medium fleets, and that optimal multi-robot methods such as CBS trade computation time for guarantees. The present project combines the first two in a single, measured implementation.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4900 0 R
>>
endobj
