/Title (Greedy is fast but unreliable. It expanded the fewest nodes but returned non-optimal routes on up to 16.2% of queries, with a worst case of 2.47 times the optimum on the small floor. Independent planning is unsafe. About one in four three-robot scenarios and three in four six-robot scenarios contained at least one conflict, even though each individual route was optimal.)
/Dest [44 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4845 0 R
