/Title (The proposed system models the warehouse as a weighted grid and provides a library of single-robot planners \(BFS, Dijkstra, A*, Greedy\) behind a common interface. For fleets it adds a prioritised space-time A* planner: robots are planned in priority order, each robot searches over \(x, y, time\) states, and the resulting path is written to a reservation table that later robots must respect. A browser interface served from localhost:8080 shows the warehouse and three robots, and a separate benchmark harness evaluates the planners over randomised scenarios.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4953 0 R
>>
endobj
