/Title (Before measurement the JVM is warmed up with 300 repetitions of representative queries so that the first results are not dominated by class loading. For each size, 500 queries are drawn from a seeded random generator, and every algorithm is run on the same query. Aggregates are written to a summary file. Multi-robot scenarios are generated from a separate seed; each scenario is solved both independently and with reservations, and the checker is run on both sets of plans.)
/Dest [40 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4959 0 R
>>
