5092 0 obj
<<
/Title (Allowing a robot to wait is essential: without waiting, a robot could not let another pass in a one-cell-wide corridor. A robot that finishes early is not removed from the map. Its goal cell is reserved for every later time step up to the horizon T, and a later robot may enter that cell only before the finishing time. The planner also refuses to accept a goal state at time t if the goal cell is reserved at time t or later, because the robot would have to leave and return.)
/Dest [37 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5077 0 R
>>
endobj
